<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Pray to touch the throne of God,</l><l>Deeply sense thy need of grace;</l><l>In the spirit stay with God,</l><l>Fellowshipping face to face.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Pray to touch the throne of God,</l><l>Learning all the wealth of grace;</l><l>Ever take and ever taste,</l><l>Giving God the thanks and praise.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Pray to touch the throne of God,</l><l>Touch the throne of power too;</l><l>In the name of Jesus Christ</l><l>Deal with what you have to do.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Pray to touch the throne of God</l><l>By the hand of living faith;</l><l>Exercise authority</l><l>Over all the pow’r of death.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Pray to touch the throne of God,</l><l>Pray to shake the evil pow’r;</l><l>Pray with kingship on the throne,</l><l>Pray with Christ this very hour.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
